  "Adds a transcript icon to every file in your Library — click it to create a chord chart PDF in the ORFEO folder. Charts number the bars as the file has them, so switching this on switches off Skip empty bars at the start.": "",
  "Adds Export to audio… to a song's right-click menu in the Library. Choose the version (the song as written, Focus, or as you hear it now), the sound and the format. Files go to the Exports folder inside your Library's Orfeo folder.": "",
