  "Orfeo {{v0}} is out. Click to download": "",
  "Orfeo handling the key": "",
  "Orfeo is here to make your musical journey a little more enjoyable, one note at a time. A rating in the Microsoft Store helps other musicians find it, and it only takes a moment.": "",
  "Orfeo is here to make your musical journey a little more enjoyable, one note at a time. It's free and made by one musician. Here's how you can help it grow.": "",
  "Orfeo measures how late your sound output plays and lights keys, counts in and reads taps to match. If it still feels off — Bluetooth headphones, or General MIDI played through an external instrument — shift it here. This moves the picture, not the sound: no setting can make a note arrive sooner.": "",
  "Orfeo shares the sound card with everything else, so you still hear YouTube, video calls and other apps alongside it. Windows adds its usual delay between key and sound.": "",
  "Orfeo takes over the whole sound card: other apps stay silent while Orfeo is open.": "",
  "Orfeo talks to your sound card directly, past Windows' mixer: the shortest delay from key to sound. Recommended when the delay between pressing a key and hearing it feels uncomfortable.": "",
